#
# See https://journals.iucr.org/services/cif/checking/prefilter.html for more info
#
# The lines in this file are read as follows:
# TYPE_XXX		Entry		Check types
# 
# ---Keyword-------Check----------------------------------------------------
#    PRES          Must be present in CIF file
#    CHAR          Must be of type 'char'
#    NUMB          Must be of type 'numb' (number, either float or integer)
#    NOEM          Must be non-empty
#    HYDR		   Must be present if structure contains any H atoms
#    FRAC          Must not contain fractions as decimals;
#                  checked by presence of any dot symbols  
#    GRUP-X        All entries, listed in a group No. X,
#                  must be present and given, if at least one non-'?'
#                  value is present. 1 <= X <= 9
#    LEAS-X        At least one of the entries, listed in group, must
#                  be present and given. 1<= X <= 9
#    OLDE          Old entry type, comment to change it
#    REFL          Special check for DIFF_012 entry:
#                  must be present if _reflns_number_total != _reflns_number_gt
#                  or _reflns_number_observed. Must be 0 if present and _total = _gt
#    ABSS          Special GRUP-like check for REFL_021 entry:
#                  type - _refine_ls_abs_structure_*
#                  if _details are present, then _Flack or _Rogers must be present
#                  and vice versa
#
#    
